sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Query initial state, then receive mutation-driven updates
accDescr: A viewer subscribes to an authorized topic, and a comment mutation persists data and causes AppSync to push the matching update.
participant V as Topic viewer
participant A as AppSync
participant W as Comment author
participant D as DynamoDB
V->>A: Query initial comments
A->>D: Read topic data
D-->>A: Current comments
A-->>V: Initial state
V->>A: Subscribe to authorized topic
W->>A: Create-comment mutation
A->>D: Persist comment
D-->>A: Mutation result
A-->>V: Matching subscription update
Note over A,D: Direct table writes alone do not trigger this subscription
